<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, we're almost there."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Someone was shaking me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A slight pain in my neck.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I realized I'd been sleeping with my head slumped over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">When I opened my eyes, it was dusk outside.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"5 more minutes to the last station. Make sure you're wide awake."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">We'd come that far already?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">After changing trains so many times, I was understandably tired by the second half.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">We talked up a storm, but in the end we never discussed the overnight trip.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, wake up. We'll leave you behind!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Beside me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was sleeping blissfully.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Not just my brains, but my face and figure too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mumbling nonsense in her sleep, she was drooling from her grinning mouth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was surprisingly sloppy when she slept.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We seemed to have come pretty deep into the mountains.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The train had only one car, and we were the only ones on it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―Or so I thought, but there was one more person, on the side-facing bench farthest from us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Mid-20s, maybe?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A woman was sitting alone, perfectly still.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A foreigner...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Her hair color and her skin were different from ours.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> spoke to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">the woman</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="4">, you finally noticed me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I was so lonely..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The woman called Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> turned a </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="はかな">fleeting</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> smile on us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Wait, <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, you were hiding your face on purpose, weren't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Hehe. I thought I might get all the way to the end without being found out, but it seems that was impossible."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, were you really on from the start? There's no way we wouldn't notice on a one-car train..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... I got on partway. And all three of you were sound asleep."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Partway? Is there even a station between Arata and Toyotake?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... If you put your thumb up by the tracks, it'll stop for you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">This train is practically a volunteer operation, so it's flexible."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hitchhiking a train... 
{PAUSE ""}
What were you doing out there...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... I saw some nice wild mountain greens, so I had them let me off partway. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Here."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\山菜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">The woman called Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> spread open a bag of wild mountain greens.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There really were lots of tasty-looking wild greens in it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">As I was puzzling over it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> turned her face toward me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">the woman called Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> came closer to me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... How do you do. I am </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="4">'s cousin. My name is </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> Niimura. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> two must be </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="4">'s friends?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, I am Natsumi Kogori. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I am always most honorably being looked after by </STYLE>Haruka-san<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'd greeted her in some bizarre honorific speech...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"So, the one sleeping over here is <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき逆.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... So this little one is the famous </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="4"> has told me about her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Such a cute sleeping face..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n400\r\n4000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n400\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said that and brought her face close to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s sleeping one.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Hngh...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Hello, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-400\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-400\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\倒れる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Waaaaah!!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s face closing in startled </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who screamed and did two backward rolls on the side-facing bench.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wh-wh-wh-wh-wh-wh-who are you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Hehe, you really are cute..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-280\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-280\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went up to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and stroked her chin.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had no idea what was going on and looked </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Come on, <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE>... that's taking the prank too far."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">this child</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> has such squishy cheeks and eyes like a doll's... she's just so cute. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Oh my, you're drooling. Let me wipe it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-280\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-280\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"H-help me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> still didn't seem to grasp the situation.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hah! Hah! Wh-wh-who is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">this person</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Alrighty, we're getting off soon!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">, please don't ignore me!"</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The train started to slow down.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "160" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Let's go together, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> took </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Y... yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> always uses her so-called strike-first-and-win operation to drag people she's just met into </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">her own</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> rhythm, but she was being completely outplayed by </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, how are you getting to the settlement?
{PAUSE ""}
　Gonna ride in <STYLE ID="9">my mom</STYLE>'s car?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... That was the plan from the start. Didn't you hear?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく全身.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Uh, did I...? 
{PAUSE ""}
Now that you mention it, I think I heard something..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Odds are, this is just </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> not remembering...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... what is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">that</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hid behind me and stared balefully at </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">she's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, she said. </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s cousin, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I don't like..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Well, if that was their first meeting, it was no wonder.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
