{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> took the passenger seat, and I sat next to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
