<STYLE ID="2">Or rather, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was crowding in, pushing </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> to the edge.</STYLE>
