<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-300\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱覗き込み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-300\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Then, suddenly, she grabbed both my hands.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, will you listen to me!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　The start of a party is fine, the start!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Everyone fusses over me, and I'm considerate of everyone and act just right!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　There are lots of wonderful men, and they give me their contact info right away!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　But...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">but...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s eyes overflowed with big, spilling tears.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Before I know it, it's morning, and none of the men answer anymore!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　What do you think of that!? Isn't it awful!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　The day before yesterday, when I woke up in the morning, I was asleep in a roadside gutter!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She was pleading desperately, but for some reason I couldn't bring myself to sympathize.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or rather, I didn't get what 'before I know it, it's morning' meant.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Why could that be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I know I shouldn't say it myself, but I don't think my face is that bad. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Could I have done something when I blacked out from drinking...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ah, so drunken mishaps were the cause.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Faced with a weeping </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> asking herself questions and answering them over and over, all I could manage was a wry smile.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">―Just then, a buzzing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s phone, it seemed.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n30000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... It's a friend from college. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Um... sending the photos from the last party, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">it's about time </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">faced reality...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She stared at her phone for a while, then gradually started to tremble.</STYLE>
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "0" "0" "30"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, still looking down, silently handed me the phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Did that mean I should look?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "300" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Ah, I see...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Chugging beer from a pitcher, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Drinking sake from a giant cup (clearly a platter that had held food) like a sumo wrestler who has just won a tournament, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Straddling a man and forcing a beer bottle into his mouth, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I handed the phone back in silence too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So this is the kind of person they call a disappointing beauty...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No wonder men keep their distance.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Right now, the only thing I live for is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
