{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I love you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hugged </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> looked like she might foam at the mouth any second.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> was right. She really was quite something...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The only word that came to mind was disappointing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Would </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> really make it home alive?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or rather, would she even be allowed to go home?</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Oh my? We're a little short on time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Maybe we'd better hurry?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE>... please, drive safe..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But suddenly I felt the tires spin, and heard an engine roar that made me want to cover my ears.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車爆走中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "55"}
<PG>
