{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\美冬運転.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "16" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Now... here we go...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\危機.ogg" "BGM" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夕方.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">The huge van started tearing down the narrow mountain road.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If anyone had been on a road like this, they surely would have been sent flying before they could dodge.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In the rear-view mirror, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s face was really scary.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I feel like I saw </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> with a face like that when I was little, but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I never imagined I'd be riding a thrill ride this deep in the mountains.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> once told me that </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has an extreme side, so watch out when she goes wild, and that her true nature comes out behind the wheel.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Twisted into a </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="まんじ">manji</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> shape, I </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="か">took to heart</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> just how reliable that information had been.</STYLE>
